<title>GERMANY: EMI to unveil money policy plans for EMU on Jan 10.</title>
<headline>EMI to unveil money policy plans for EMU on Jan 10.</headline>
<text>
<p>FRANKFURT, Jan 2 (Reuer) - The European Monetary Institute (EMI) will hold a press conference on January 10 to present a report, &quot;The Single Monetary Policy in Stage Three - Specification of the Operational Framework.&quot;</p>
<p>The press conference, which EMI president Alexandre Lamfalussy will attend, is scheduled to start at 1000 GMT.</p>
<p>The EMI, the forerunner of the European Central Bank, said the report would cover regulatory, organisational and logistical factors that the European System of Central Banks will face in conducting monetary policy.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
